sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Frontend / Browser
    participant Gateway as FastAPI Application
    participant Middleware as RequestID Middleware
    participant ReadyEndpoint as /api/v1/ready
    participant Service as HealthService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16 (pgvector)

    Client->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/ready (Optional X-Request-ID)
    Gateway->>Middleware: Intercept incoming request
    alt X-Request-ID present and valid
        Middleware->>Middleware: Bind request_id to context
    else X-Request-ID missing or invalid
        Middleware->>Middleware: Generate new UUIDv4 request_id
    end
    Middleware->>ReadyEndpoint: Dispatch request
    ReadyEndpoint->>Service: check_readiness(db_session)
    Service->>DB: Execute SELECT 1 (timeout=5.0s)
    alt Database responds OK
        DB-->>Service: 1 (Connected)
        Service-->>ReadyEndpoint: ReadinessStatus(status="ready", database=True)
        ReadyEndpoint-->>Middleware: 200 OK + JSON body
    else Database connection fails / times out
        DB-->>Service: ConnectionError / Timeout
        Service-->>ReadyEndpoint: ReadinessStatus(status="degraded", database=False)
        ReadyEndpoint-->>Middleware: 503 Service Unavailable + JSON body
    end
    Middleware->>Client: Return Response + X-Request-ID header
